  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - Gaza - Education in Emergencies and Mental Health and Psychosocial Suppo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNRWA will continue providing individual and group MHPSS sessions to up to 462,000 children through its counsellors and assistant counsellors, complemented by recreational kits for up to 220,000 families with children.  In 2025, UNRWA plans to establish additional temporary learning spaces in accessible areas, resume formal remote education using printed materials and content on the UNRWA Digital Learning Platform tailored by grade and subject, and prioritize in-person education for grades 1&#x2013;4 through structured routines.</narrative>
  </description>
